      "context": {
        "title": {
          "en": "Context quality",
          "zh-cn": "上下文质量"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "plugins": [
    {
      "name": "dsh-aiignore",
      "title": {
        "en": "dsh-aiignore",
        "zh-cn": "dsh-aiignore"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Stops your coding agent from reading the wrong files: it scores a workspace by context noise, follows the conversation you are in, explains the score per category, filters at the strength you choose, and applies the suggested .aiignore in one click.",
        "zh": "阻止编码代理读错文件：按上下文噪音给仓库打分，跟随你当前所在的对话，按类别解释分数，以你选择的力度过滤，并可一键写入建议的 .aiignore。",
        "zh-cn": "跟随当前对话：读取应用正在展示的会话，审计它所在目录，并把用过的所有工作区按健康度排在左侧栏的一个页面里，第一次扫描之前不需要手动选择。"
      },
      "author": "WJDdidi-1",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/WJDdidi-1/ai-context-doctor",
